    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82965" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πηλόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>coat</i> or <i>daub with clay,</i>
